# Work on main

This repo has one operator. Default to `main`.

1. Check out `main` if the workspace is on a leftover feature branch.
2. Commit and push on `main` when the user asks to commit or push.
3. Do not create `feat/`, `fix/`, or other topic branches.
4. Do not open a pull request.
5. Branch only when the user names a reason (parallel experiment, review, release).
